<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I am following up on your enquiry regarding your recent request for a replication of a non AUD receipt.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Unfortunately Qantas is not able to provide a tax invoice for transactions outside of Australia.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Qantas can assist with providing a duplicate receipt for international bookings and bookings ticketed and issued in another currency. However this is not a tax invoice.&nbsp;</p>
